{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51625","headline":"北渠（历代宫苑殿阁制度） · 朱存","name":"北渠（历代宫苑殿阁制度）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金殿分来玉砌流，黑龙湖彻凤池头。\n後庭花落恩波断，翻与南唐作御沟。\n（〖1〗「南唐」，张敦颐《六朝事迹编类》卷上〖作杨修诗〗引作「南塘」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}